# The EAS (Expo) build only needs the mobile/ app. Everything below is
# excluded from the uploaded build archive to keep it small and fast.
#
# NOTE: when .easignore exists, EAS ignores .gitignore entirely — so every
# secret-bearing or bulky path has to be repeated here, not just inherited.

Avtotime-1/
frontend_market/
scripts/
docs/
.venv/
.github/
node_modules/

# Local dev junk that must never be uploaded
**/.mongo-*/
**/.mongo-binaries/
**/*.log

# Credentials and signing material — must never leave the machine.
# google-services.json / GoogleService-Info.plist are deliberately NOT here:
# the Android/iOS FCM client configs must ship with the build.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*.p8
*.p12
*.jks
*.key
*.pem
.mcp.json

# Tooling / editor state
.expo/
.claude/
.codex/
.vscode/

# Local data dumps and internal notes
all_tickets_parsed.json
new_tickets_raw.txt
INFRASTRUCTURE.md
README.md
